 * product wording table) and checked in, so the APK never needs Python, OpenCC or a network
 * round trip at runtime.
 *
 * Three tables, all keyed on text the app itself wrote:
 *
 *  - [EXACT] holds complete strings. Only the app's own copy is a key; engine errors, game
 *    text and unknown diagnostics are not, so [text] returns them verbatim.
 *  - [TEMPLATES] holds the same copy with every interpolated value replaced by a `#`
 *    placeholder (`发现新版本 #`). The value the caller passed -- a version, a size, a date,
 *    an event id -- is copied byte for byte, so a dynamic message can never be damaged by a
 *    character conversion; only the wording around it is translated.
 *  - [SHAPES] holds number-only shapes that are composed without interpolation (`放铳风险指数 `
 *    + n), with the number copied untouched.
 *
 * All three are constant tables compiled into the dex; this is not a general text translator.
 */
